[[br]][=#sha512]
= sha512 =

The '''sha512''' module is a one-way encryption module that encrypts the password using the [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SHA-2 SHA-512] algorithm.  This module has no parameters.

{{{#!blockquote
{{{#!code
@parts/sqlrelay-pwdencs-sha512.conf@
}}}
}}}

Since the SHA-512 algorithm is one-way, it can be used to encrypt passwords for SQL Relay users, but not database users.

----

